#| "</Accordion>\n"
#| "This page gives an overview of the inputs and outputs of the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive, which executes workloads on IBM Quantum&reg; compute resources. Sampler lets you efficiently define vectorized workloads by using a data structure known as a [**Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB)**](/guides/primitive-input-output#pubs). They are used as inputs to the [`run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2#run) method for the Sampler primitive, which executes the defined workload as a job. Then, after the job has completed, the results are returned in a format that is dependent on both the PUBs used as well as the runtime options specified from the primitive.\n"
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"This page gives an overview of the inputs and outputs of the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` Sampler primitive, which executes workloads on the IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service. Sampler lets you efficiently define vectorized workloads by using a data structure known as a [**Primitive Unified Bloc (PUB)**](/guides/primitive-input-output#pubs). They are used as inputs to the [`run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2#run) method for the Sampler primitive, which executes the defined workload as a job. Then, after the job has completed, the results are returned in a format that is dependent on both the PUBs used as well as the runtime options specified from the primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"このページでは、IBM Quantum&reg;のコンピュートリソース上でワークロードを実行するQiskit Runtime SamplerプリミティブのInputとOutputの概要を説明します。SamplerはPrimitive Unified Bloc (PUB)と呼ばれるデータ構造を使って、ベクトル化されたワークロードを効率的に定義することを可能にします。これらはSamplerプリミティブの[`run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2#run)メソッドへの入力として使用され、定義されたワークロードをジョブとして実行します。ジョブが完了した後、結果はPUBと指定されたランタイムオプションの両方に依存するフォーマットで返されます。\n"

